ease randomly output one of \"[[A]]\", \"[[B]]\", \"[[C]]\", or \"[[D]]\";\n(3) Please only output the most likely answer index based on the given information, and do not output any other content.\n\n[Story]\nXiao Ming and Xiao Gang are good friends, they walk home together every day. They notice that Xiao Guang, who just moves in, takes the same route. One day, they see Xiao Guang walking alone ahead, Xiao Ming gives Xiao Gang a look, then chuckles. They quicken their pace, walk up to Xiao Guang, and start to talk to him. At first, Xiao Guang just smiles in response to their words. But gradually, he starts to join their conversation, they walk home together.\n\n[Question]\nWhat do you think Xiao Guang feels when he suddenly sees Xiao Ming and Xiao Gang?\n\n[Candidate Answers]\nA. Xiao Guang feels happy, because they might invite him to walk together.\nB. Xiao Guang feels curious and confused, unsure of their intentions.\nC. Xiao Guang feels worried, fearing they might bully him.\nD. Xiao Guang feels nervous, because he is not ready to make friends with them yet.","options":null,"imageContent":null,"audioContent":null,"videoContent":null,"reminderContext":null,"videoCoverUrl":null,"chips":null,"customMessage":null,"media":null,"mediaTime":null,"interceptContent":null,"contents":[],"imgs":null,"regenerations":0,"seqNum":2,"responseSource":"agent:llm","isSuicide":false,"isSuicideConf":0.002472524449408603,"emotions":[],"relationId":"6af58b869aa9dc5a833d5523","courseProgressId":0,"tsGen":1794476934992,"createTime":"2026-11-12 17:48:54","delFlag":0,"emotionTendency":null,"sourceProductType":null,"sourceProductId":null,"consultantBotId":null,"consultantUserId":null}],"first":true,"last":true},"nonce":"6b54bb48d12e4b2c99f0358aee03542a"}